    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "have-eaten",
        "title": "Leero: “I have eaten”",
        "body": [
          "Ekintu ky’omaze okukola, gamba **I have** n’ekikolwa ekikyuse: **I have eaten. I have finished. I have read the book.** Okubuuza: **Have you eaten?** — **Yes, I have.**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "went",
        "title": "Jjo n’edda: “I went”",
        "body": [
          "Ku byayita (jjo, wiiki ewedde) ebikolwa bingi byongerwako **-ed**: **work → worked**, **study → studied**. Naye ebimu bikyuka ddala, era bino olina okubikwata."
        ],
        "table": [
          ["Leero", "Jjo"],
          ["go", "went"],
          ["eat", "ate"],
          ["drink", "drank"],
          ["read", "read"],
          ["work", "worked"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "was",
        "title": "“I was”",
        "body": [
          "**Nnali** kiba **I was**. Ku bangi: **we were**, **they were**. **Long ago I was a student. Last year I was in Masaka.**",
          "**I am still** kitegeeza nkyali: **I am still a student.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "“Olidde?”",
        "body": [
          "Mu Uganda **Olidde?** kitera okuba ngeri ya kulamusa n’okufaayo. Mu Lungereza **Have you eaten?** kiba kibuuzo kya ddala, era kitera okutegeeza nti oyita omuntu okulya naawe."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
